    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that feels like such a cope though. like, we're just making up stories to distract ourselves from the fact that we're just biological accidents. if the resistance is just a way to pretend the void isn't there, doesn't that just make the struggle more pathetic? it feels like we're just running on a treadmill that leads nowhere.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
